TOUCHED: src/components/providers/SmoothScroll.tsx, src/components/providers/TransitionProvider.tsx, src/components/ui/TransitionLink.tsx, src/components/ui/RevealText.tsx, src/components/ui/ParallaxImage.tsx, src/components/ui/MagneticButton.tsx, src/components/ui/Accordion.tsx, src/components/ui/WhatsAppFab.tsx, src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx, src/components/layout/Footer.tsx, src/app/layout.tsx

I created the foundational motion, UI, and layout primitives for Yabhasyuka following an elevated, quiet luxury aesthetic with long, generous GSAP eases (`power3.out`, `expo.out`) and robust accessibility support. Specifically, I implemented [SmoothScroll](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/providers/SmoothScroll.tsx) using `lenis/react` synchronized directly to GSAP's ticker and ScrollTrigger update cycle, and [TransitionProvider](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/providers/TransitionProvider.tsx) with a full-screen sweep-up overlay transition, hash anchor smooth-scrolling, and instant scroll-to-top on route changes via the exported `useTransitionRouter()` hook. For UI interactions, I built [TransitionLink](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/ui/TransitionLink.tsx) to seamlessly bridge route transitions and anchor scrolling while respecting browser modifier clicks, [RevealText](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/ui/RevealText.tsx) leveraging GSAP's `SplitText` with `document.fonts.ready` synchronization for staggered line reveals, [ParallaxImage](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/ui/ParallaxImage.tsx) with ScrollTrigger scrubbing and an initial scale-down enter reveal, [MagneticButton](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/ui/MagneticButton.tsx) using `gsap.quickTo` for cursor attraction on fine-pointer desktop devices, an accessible [Accordion](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/ui/Accordion.tsx) with GSAP height-auto animations and rotating indicators, and a floating [WhatsAppFab](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/ui/WhatsAppFab.tsx) with inline SVG glyphs and mount scaling. Finally, I crafted the responsive [Navbar](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/layout/Navbar.tsx) with scroll-dependent backdrop blurring and a full-screen staggered mobile menu, the sculptural [Footer](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/components/layout/Footer.tsx) featuring a massive `12vw` editorial wordmark and organized navigation columns, and wrapped the application root in [layout.tsx](file:///Users/nathan/Documents/code/Yabhasyuka/yabhasyuka-client/.claude/worktrees/website-template/src/app/layout.tsx) with the smooth scroll and transition providers while ensuring strict TypeScript compliance and proper reduced-motion fallbacks across all components.
